            "review_title": "Review at Fiftysix",
            "review_text": "Peter F\nSydney, Australia15 contributions\n0\nunforgettable dinning experience.\nApr 2023 • Friends\nI have been here every time I visit Saigon. It is a real break from the chaos of central Saigon. The atmosphere is very relaxing and only a short distance from district 1.\nThe food and service is of a high standard. The host Nic who is also the chef has a great knowledge of food and he can always suggest of perfect wine or beer pairing to go with your unbelievable meal. I'm sure when you arrive JoJo will be happy to look after you throughout your evening. This is my third time here and every time the service friendliness is so welcoming and the quality of the food something to write home about.\nSo next time your in Saigon head on over to Binh Thanh for a unforgettable dining experience, you wont be disappointed.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten May 26, 2023",
